{"description":"We are going to moon","image":"https://assets.spaceappschallenge.org/media/images/cat_on_the_earth_TYKHvET.2e16d0ba.fill-300x250.jpg","summary":"WE are group of students of grade 6th-8th. We want to present the idea of how can ISS be used as saver of the rovers left behind. We may modify ISS by adding fuel jets and evacuating the astronauts and researchers.","details":"<p>It is just a storytelling through comic style and we want to propose the idea of usage of ISS for one last mission before it crashes back to Earth. </p>","dataRefs":[["LRVs","https://nssdc.gsfc.nasa.gov/nmc/spacecraft/display.action?id=1971-063C"],["Insight and Phoniex","https://science.nasa.gov/mission/insight/"]],"projectRefs":[],"members":[{"name":"Chehak Singh","country":"India","avatar":"https://assets.spaceappschallenge.org/media/images/cat_on_the_earth.2e16d0ba.fill-64x64.jpg","owner":true},{"name":"Adhvik Singhal","country":"India","avatar":"https://assets.spaceappschallenge.org/media/images/1D9EC3F8-AA45-46DA-A8F0-7298DDCF6ACB.2e16d0ba.fill-64x64.png","owner":false},{"name":"Avyukt Aggarwal","country":"India","avatar":null,"owner":false},{"name":"Kiaan Jain","country":"India","avatar":null,"owner":false},{"name":"Mannat Srivastava","country":"India","avatar":"https://assets.spaceappschallenge.org/media/images/IMG_0449_cWy2wqq.2e16d0ba.fill-64x64.jpg","owner":false},{"name":"kavish khanna","country":"India","avatar":null,"owner":false}]}